99
00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.670
has been going beyond the walls

100
00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:29.110
of their hospitals and into their communities.

101
00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:32.045
Hi Catherine, thank you so much for joining us today.

102
00:04:32.045 --> 00:04:34.389
(audience clapping)

103
00:04:34.389 --> 00:04:37.470
Thank you Drew it's great to join you.

104
00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:38.560
Catherine. I was wondering

105
00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:41.603
