115
00:05:00.741 --> 00:05:02.324
(audience clapping)

116
00:05:02.324 --> 00:05:03.540
Thank you, that is a blessing.

117
00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:05.407
Thank you so much.

118
00:05:05.407 --> 00:05:08.390
We are so happy to be apart this Principle Dockery

119
00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:10.560
