120
00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:14.460
Texas Health is dedicated to providing quality clinical care

121
00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.390
across all our access points.

122
00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:18.750
So congratulations.

123
00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.950
Thank you. Thank you. Thank you so much.

124
00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:23.040
Such a blessing

125
00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:25.110
Principal Dockery I wanted to also let you know

126
00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:27.205
that our friends at Omaha Steaks heard about your story

127
00:05:27.205 --> 00:05:31.710
