129
00:05:33.628 --> 00:05:34.667
(audience clapping)

130
00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:36.793
Thank you. Thank you

131
00:05:36.793 --> 00:05:38.120
Oh that's not all,

132
00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:40.080
they're also going to throw in $4,000 worth

133
00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:43.326
