134
00:05:43.326 --> 00:05:44.185
(audience clapping)

135
00:05:44.185 --> 00:05:48.100
Oh my gosh. Thank you so much. Wow.

136
00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:50.495
Catherine, thank you so much

137
00:05:50.495 --> 00:05:53.020
for contributing to this program.

138
00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:55.609
You are the seed of change

139
00:05:55.609 --> 00:05:58.580
for this school and Principal Dockery.

140
00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.413
Thank you so much.

141
00:05:59.413 --> 00:06:02.270
And to Omaha Steaks, who's also playing such a big part

142
00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:04.630 line:15%
